# Next.js UI (Frontend / Admin)

- Stack: Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind, shadcn-style primitives
- Frontend is public portal; Admin is JWT-gated operator UI
- Browser calls `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`; server may use `API_INTERNAL_URL`
- UI i18n: `de` / `en`; resolve cookie `oeh_locale` → `Accept-Language` → default **`de`**
- Do not invent purple/Inter default aesthetics; follow existing theme tokens
- Keep SEO metadata / JSON-LD on public event pages (`docs/SEO.md`)
- Docs: `docs/FRONTEND.md`, `docs/ADMIN_CENTER.md`, `docs/SEARCH_UI.md`
